{
"file": 23,
"paths": [
"d002/f625"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "dea2599d",
"en_raw": "...A white suicide note?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "0774ffcc",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "5b3ebd5f",
"en_raw": "If you chant that spell at a crossing"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "cd7ad3b3",
"en_raw": "the ghost of someone who died there"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "ba6ffeec",
"en_raw": "comes out and grabs your leg"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "e6dbd97a",
"en_raw": "It's stupid, or rather"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "b63209d5",
"en_raw": "it is stupid, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "33ce45a9",
"en_raw": "So what did Sango say?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "a01e5715",
"en_raw": "She said she'd do it if it doesn't hurt"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "b41ddef4",
"en_raw": "...She said that?"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "a8bc0cdc",
"en_raw": "The mood got that way"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "3b905eaa",
"en_raw": "Then that medium girl"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "1799f074",
"en_raw": "got carried away and told every girl"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "02a8ea06",
"en_raw": "in the class"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "01641229",
"en_raw": "...Shiina, were you called too?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "95a713ad",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't know"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "b8ae6b82",
"en_raw": "...What a lousy class, honestly"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "e623c0b5",
"en_raw": "Sango, you'd better not"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "e363654f",
"en_raw": "Huh?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "7ac33b96",
"en_raw": "She must be really confident"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "1eb680d3",
"en_raw": "If she really gets her leg grabbed..."
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "f9cc31c7",
"en_raw": "Then press the emergency button"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "abd4ba0e",
"en_raw": "on the crossing gate for me"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "41960950",
"en_raw": "There's no way I'd make it in time!"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "29d145d3",
"en_raw": "I'm joking"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "875d14a2",
"en_raw": "Anyway, Nao"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "4a6ebe18",
"en_raw": "Don't fire up my motivation"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "9cb50494",
"en_raw": "any further"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "bccb0fbd",
"en_raw": "Crossing Jizo by 7 o'clock"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "b0071c7e",
"en_raw": "Will I make it..."
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "61c16358",
"en_raw": "Follow the tracks, away from the Tama"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "40dbc5e7",
"en_raw": "and it's close, but..."
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "d0eb35fa",
"en_raw": "Sango, you'd better not go"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "49d7f2bd",
"en_raw": "If I run away here"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "db747043",
"en_raw": "who knows what they'll say"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "f2f5a124",
"en_raw": "...It'll be a lifelong shame"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "a3957d23",
"en_raw": "Damn it, that Toilet Gang"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "c67dc71b",
"en_raw": "saying whatever they like"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "2a0f1d4d",
"en_raw": "Just ignore them"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "2553e19b",
"en_raw": "No way!"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "c1a766f7",
"en_raw": "If those guys get any more"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "fc892626",
"en_raw": "encouraged"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "5f8d16d2",
"en_raw": "they might start a religion"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "c2711842",
"en_raw": "in the class"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "9b7e4eb9",
"en_raw": "There's no way I'd get dragged"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "80a400f7",
"en_raw": "The train came on the opposite track"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "3b2ebd43",
"en_raw": "So your leg being stuck"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "44673a79",
"en_raw": "was all an act?"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "55389707",
"en_raw": "That's right"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "74325321",
"en_raw": "I'm amazed..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "f28a07f6",
"en_raw": "A splendid total victory, wasn't it?"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "e0ea6303",
"en_raw": "Well, the Toilet Gang will"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "3039b14e",
"en_raw": "be quiet for a while"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "72a57a2c",
"en_raw": "Hey, is Iwase somehow"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "172eba03",
"en_raw": "similar to Kume?"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "3f31f510",
"en_raw": "Kume is your friend, isn't he?"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "326344db",
"en_raw": "Is it okay to talk like that?"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "58fd8644",
"en_raw": "I'm not saying anything bad"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "c7151fb8",
"en_raw": "I just thought"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "042e6682",
"en_raw": "their interests are similar"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "0998478a",
"en_raw": "Come to think of it, Iwase and Kume"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "f75d2465",
"en_raw": "are the perfect couple"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "44ef921f",
"en_raw": "Ha ha ha ha"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "c6fdea92",
"en_raw": "I'll tell them next time"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "5f4faacd",
"en_raw": "Stop it"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "51522f0b",
"en_raw": "Well, there are differences"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "03a943dd",
"en_raw": "Lies are lies either way"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "1ebff9e5",
"en_raw": "but Kume at least does it alone"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "e7eef2b6",
"en_raw": "Iwase is tangled up with our class's"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "5a1cbe87",
"en_raw": "power center, so"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "778182f4",
"en_raw": "she's even nastier"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "26410001",
"en_raw": "...How should I put it"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "83f69f6b",
"en_raw": "like the Dark Ages of the Middle Ages"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "95b457b7",
"en_raw": "I don't really get it..."
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "39d27bed",
"en_raw": "Anyway, case closed"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "658c7e54",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the White Suicide Note"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "5cbc79c3",
"en_raw": "So your leg simply"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "cdae0de3",
"en_raw": "got caught in the track, that's all"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "4195bb0f",
"en_raw": "But Iwase predicted"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "f12501e7",
"en_raw": "that would happen"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "833ab2f5",
"en_raw": "So that's not a spirit"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "7dab415f",
"en_raw": "it's an accident"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "2bb57b19",
"en_raw": "I'd like to think so too"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "490f216e",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "94c33596",
"en_raw": "And what's worse is"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "a89d6bb1",
"en_raw": "that fake psychic girl"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "be568cb4",
"en_raw": "claiming her guardian spirit"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "f1c5ab29",
"en_raw": "saved me..."
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "ac5db1d2",
"en_raw": "If it hadn't"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "e41e9d42",
"en_raw": "Sango, you'd have been run over"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "00ee42d0",
"en_raw": "Tch, I don't even feel like arguing"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "f56671a4",
"en_raw": "It's just one blow after another"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "4f1e2cfe",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the White Suicide Note...?"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "35c21619",
"en_raw": "But when I got home"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "2019f020",
"en_raw": "there was a bright red mark on my ankle..."
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "c6db08b6",
"en_raw": "...Is that true?"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "b9f90dab",
"en_raw": "Just kidding, what"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "6003204c",
"en_raw": "are you scared?"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "53134db5",
"en_raw": "Nao is scared~"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "ec2b0ac7",
"en_raw": "You two have bad personalities..."
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "23aa32ed",
"en_raw": "Thinking about whether ghosts exist"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "6ade1e9c",
"en_raw": "with so much free time"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "c0fb413e",
"en_raw": "is how you get fooled"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "d7bc3684",
"en_raw": "I can't believe I lost to Iwase"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "96bf4455",
"en_raw": "myself"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "3b635cc8",
"en_raw": "Such a boring incident"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "4764a17c",
"en_raw": "I'll forget it quickly..."
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}